            "speaker_id": 52934,
            "reply_to": "M1",
            "text": "Thanks for the quick turnaround. I've just reviewed A1. The three tiers look like a good starting point. My main question is on the value jump from Silver to Gold. The price doubles, but the extra benefits seem minor. I'm concerned the conversion rate to Gold will be low.",
