            "msg_id": "M3",
            "speaker_id": 46183,
            "reply_to": "M2",
            "text": "Good point. Also, the 'priority support' benefit for the Gold tier needs to be clearly defined. From a consumer protection standpoint, vague promises can cause issues. We should specify what 'priority' means in A5 'Membership Policy and Internal FAQ' to avoid trouble later.",
