            "msg_id": "M5",
            "speaker_id": 54019,
            "reply_to": "M3",
            "text": "Yes, absolutely. For 'priority support', I'll define it in A5 as 'guaranteed response within 4 business hours'. That should be clear enough for the compliance check in T2.",
