            "msg_id": "M43",
            "speaker_id": 31942,
            "reply_to": "M40",
            "text": "The frequent support contact idea is clever. We tried something similar once with a 'high engagement' segment, but the data was messy and it took ages to pull a clean list. We should make sure we can actually get that data easily before we commit to it.",
            "mentions": [
              52934
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M44",
            "speaker_id": 46183,
            "reply_to": "M42",
            "text": "It's a standard report in our CRM. I can show you where to find it. For the prioritization question from @54019, I'd suggest we start with the expiring contracts. It's the most natural conversation starter.",
