        "thread_id": "TH4",
        "thread_goal": "Run pilot, capture feedback, and refine tiers and messaging.",
        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M56",
            "speaker_id": 52934,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Quick update: I've completed my 10 pilot calls for T9. Overall feedback was positive, but a few key themes emerged. I've logged the detailed notes in A4, but the main takeaway is that 4 out of 10 people found the jump from Silver to Gold confusing. They weren't clear on the value of the webinar.",
            "mentions": [
              31942,
              46183,
              54019,
              488135
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A4",
              "T9"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "chart_with_upwards_trend",
                "count": 2
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M57",
            "speaker_id": 46183,
            "reply_to": "M56",
            "text": "I'm seeing the same thing in my calls. The webinar benefit isn't landing as strongly as we'd hoped. Also, a new objection came up twice: 'Can I get a trial of the Gold tier?'. We don't have a response for that in A3.",
            "mentions": [
              52934
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A3"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "thinking_face",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M58",
            "speaker_id": 54019,
            "reply_to": "M57",
            "text": "This is very valuable feedback. If the webinar isn't working, maybe we need to replace that benefit in A1 entirely. We need to act on this before launch.",
            "mentions": [
              46183,
              52934
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A1"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M59",
            "speaker_id": 488135,
            "reply_to": "M56",
            "text": "My calls went okay. A few people said they'd 'think about it'. I added my notes to A4.",
            "mentions": [
              52934
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A4"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M60",
            "speaker_id": 31942,
            "reply_to": "M56",
            "text": "I got a lot of questions about what topics the webinars would cover. People seemed interested but skeptical. One person said they'd pay for Gold if they could see the webinar schedule for the whole year in advance. The feedback is all in my notes, it's a bit messy but it's there.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M61",
            "speaker_id": 46183,
            "reply_to": "M58",
            "text": "I don't think we need to replace the benefit entirely. That could be a big change. Based on the feedback, it sounds more like a communication issue. What if we refine the script in A2 to better explain the *type* of exclusive content they'll get? We could call it 'Expert Masterclass' instead of 'webinar'.",
            "mentions": [
              54019
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A2"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "bulb",
                "count": 3
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M62",
            "speaker_id": 52934,
            "reply_to": "M61",
            "text": "I love that. 'Expert Masterclass' sounds much more premium. It's a messaging tweak, not a structural change to A1. Much faster and safer to implement for T10. I think that's the right move.",
            "mentions": [
              46183
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A1",
              "T10"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "+1",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M63",
            "speaker_id": 54019,
            "reply_to": "M61",
            "text": "Okay, that makes sense. A messaging change is much easier. So we'll update the wording in A1 and A2. What about the 'trial' question?",
            "mentions": [
              46183
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A1",
              "A2"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M64",
            "speaker_id": 46183,
            "reply_to": "M63",
            "text": "For trials, our policy doesn't support them right now. We should add it to the A3 cheat sheet with a response like: 'We don't offer free trials, but our membership comes with a 30-day money-back guarantee, so you can experience the benefits risk-free.'",
            "mentions": [
              54019
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A3"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M65",
            "speaker_id": 52934,
            "reply_to": "M64",
            "text": "Perfect response. It handles the objection and reinforces value.",
            "mentions": [
              46183
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M66",
            "speaker_id": 54019,
            "reply_to": "M64",
            "text": "Okay, let's formalize this. Based on the pilot feedback from T9, we are deciding on the following changes for T10: 1. Rebrand the 'webinar' benefit to 'Expert Masterclass' in all materials (A1, A2). 2. Add the 'Gold trial request' objection to A3 with the proposed 'money-back guarantee' response. Are we all in agreement?",
            "mentions": [
              31942,
              46183,
              52934,
              488135
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A1",
              "A2",
              "A3",
              "T9",
              "T10"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D7"
            ],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "white_check_mark",
                "count": 4
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M67",
            "speaker_id": 46183,
            "reply_to": "M66",
            "text": "Agreed. That's a solid plan.",
            "mentions": [
              54019
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M68",
            "speaker_id": 31942,
            "reply_to": "M66",
            "text": "Yes, that addresses the feedback I heard too.",
            "mentions": [
              54019
